# UPSC Prep App — Cursor Rules
# Flutter + Dart + Hooks Riverpod + Drift (SQLite)
# Every rule here applies to every file generated in this project.

---

## Project Overview

A UPSC civil services exam preparation app. 30,000 MCQs stored in a pre-built SQLite
database bundled with the app. Users take subject-wise and topic-wise tests in two modes:
Exam mode and Learning mode. The app uses Hooks Riverpod for state management and
Drift for SQLite ORM.

---

## Tech Stack

- Flutter (latest stable)
- Dart
- hooks_riverpod — all state management
- flutter_hooks — local ephemeral UI state and hook-based lifecycle
- riverpod_annotation + riverpod_generator — code generation for providers
- Drift — SQLite ORM for user data (attempts, sessions, bookmarks, revision queue)
- sqflite + path_provider — for copying and accessing the pre-built question database
- google_fonts — DM Sans only
- go_router — navigation

---

## Folder Structure

```
lib/
  core/
    theme/
      app_theme.dart         # ThemeData light + dark
      app_colors.dart        # All color tokens
      app_text_styles.dart   # All text styles
      app_spacing.dart       # Spacing constants
    database/
