### Text Styles — app_text_styles.dart

All styles use DM Sans via GoogleFonts. Color is set at the widget level using
Theme.of(context).colorScheme — never hardcoded in text styles.

```dart
class AppTextStyles {
  // Headings
  static TextStyle h1() => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 22, fontWeight: FontWeight.w500);
  static TextStyle h2() => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 18, fontWeight: FontWeight.w500);
  static TextStyle h3() => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 16, fontWeight: FontWeight.w500);

  // Body
  static TextStyle body()   => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 15, fontWeight: FontWeight.w400, height: 1.6);
  static TextStyle bodyMd() => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 14, fontWeight: FontWeight.w400, height: 1.55);
  static TextStyle bodySm() => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 13, fontWeight: FontWeight.w400, height: 1.5);

  // Labels
  static TextStyle label()   => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 14, fontWeight: FontWeight.w500);
  static TextStyle labelSm() => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 12, fontWeight: FontWeight.w500);
  static TextStyle caption() => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 11, fontWeight: FontWeight.w400);

  // Question text — slightly larger for readability
  static TextStyle question() => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 15, fontWeight: FontWeight.w400, height: 1.7);

  // Option text
  static TextStyle option() => GoogleFonts.dmSans(fontSize: 14, fontWeight: FontWeight.w400, height: 1.55);
}
```

